# Line endings are part of what this repository tests, so they are pinned.
#
# A Windows runner checks out with `core.autocrlf=true` by default, which turned
# every text file into CRLF on the first Windows CI run. Two things compare
# source bytes and failed on nothing else:
#
# - `vieww-say-codegen`'s `the_counter_fixture_is_current` compares generated
#   code (LF, by the codegen contract) with the committed `counter_gen.rs`.
# - `vieww-reload`'s end-to-end test edits `examples/reload-guest/src/lib.rs`
#   by finding a multi-line landmark written with `\n`.
#
# Shell scripts also break under CRLF (`$'\r': command not found`). LF
# everywhere; `text=auto` leaves the fonts and PNGs alone.
* text=auto eol=lf

*.ttf binary
*.png binary
